HeroPickAssignTalentTree
    Events
        Unit - A unit enters (Playable map area)
    Conditions
        ((Triggering unit) is A Hero) Equal to True
    Actions
        Set VariableSet Hero = (Triggering unit)
        Game - Display to (All players) the text: Creating Talent tre...
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Beastmaster
            Then - Actions
                Custom script:   set udg_TempTalentTree =  Balance.create(GetTriggerUnit())
                Custom script:   call STK_AssignTalentTree(1, GetTriggerUnit(), udg_TempTalentTree)
                Custom script:   set udg_TempTalentTree =  Feral.create(GetTriggerUnit())
                Custom script:   call STK_AssignTalentTree(2, GetTriggerUnit(), udg_TempTalentTree)
                Custom script:   set udg_TempTalentTree =  Restoration.create(GetTriggerUnit())
                Custom script:   call STK_AssignTalentTree(3, GetTriggerUnit(), udg_TempTalentTree)
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
